msgstr "Po dokončení inštalácie by sa cesta CSRF mala nastaviť iba na čítanie."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "All folders are writable"
msgstr "Všetky priečinky sú zapisovateľné"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "RRDfile Locations"
msgstr "Umiestnenia RRDfile"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The Data Source paths could not be read, so RRDfile locations were not checked. Check them after the upgrade with the poller log."
msgstr "Cesty zdrojov dát sa nepodarilo prečítať, preto sa umiestnenia RRDfile nekontrolovali. Skontrolujte ich po upgrade pomocou logu pollera."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Every Data Source RRDfile path is inside an allowed directory"
msgstr "Cesta RRDfile každého zdroja dát je v povolenom adresári"

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Data Sources have an RRDfile path outside the RRA directory. This version only creates and updates RRDfiles inside the RRA directory or a directory listed in $config['rrd_additional_paths'] in include/config.php, so these Data Sources will stop updating until one of the following is done:"
msgstr "%d zdrojov dát má cestu RRDfile mimo adresára RRA. Táto verzia vytvára a aktualizuje RRDfile iba v adresári RRA alebo v adresári uvedenom v $config['rrd_additional_paths'] v include/config.php, takže tieto zdroje dát sa prestanú aktualizovať, kým sa neurobí jedno z nasledujúceho:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "List the directory that holds them in $config['rrd_additional_paths'] in include/config.php, for example $config['rrd_additional_paths'] = array('/data/rrd');"
msgstr "Uveďte adresár, ktorý ich obsahuje, v $config['rrd_additional_paths'] v include/config.php, napríklad $config['rrd_additional_paths'] = array('/data/rrd');"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Or move them into the RRA directory with structure_rra_paths.php --proceed: stop the poller, list their directory in $config['rrd_additional_paths'] so the script accepts them, run it, then remove the entry. Do not move them by hand and clear the Data Source Path, which starts a new, empty RRDfile."
msgstr "Alebo ich presuňte do adresára RRA pomocou structure_rra_paths.php --proceed: zastavte poller, uveďte ich adresár v $config['rrd_additional_paths'], aby ich skript akceptoval, spustite ho a potom záznam odstráňte. Nepresúvajte ich ručne a nemažte cestu zdroja dát, pretože to spustí nový, prázdny RRDfile."

